WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:39.000
I'd have preferred a baby Cra,
but this is okay.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.640
You've no idea how proud I am.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:47.280
Your face makes it pretty clear.
I'm glad you made it in time, Dally.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:49.440
Oh, that arm?

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:52.720
Yeah, you see, Rubi and I made a deal.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.760
My freedom for his life, he got a bargain.

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.840
Don't pretend you're nasty.
We know you're a big softie Shushu.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:03.040
There's no need to insult me, Eva.

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:04.720
So, what's next?

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:09.480
Now we've got Eva, Flopin and the baby,
we need to get out of here quickly.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:10.920
Did you lose Ruel?

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:13.640
He was behind me. He should be along soon.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:18.200
Dathura really seemed to have something
against him. I hope he's okay.

00:02:25.560 --> 00:02:28.480
Arpagone, my friends need me.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:33.360
And me? Don't you think I needed you
all these years? This isn't over.

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:43.080
No... not that. Not my pantie collection.

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:33.280
-Yugo?
-You could say that, yes.

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:35.320
I don't get it.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.280
It's complicated,
but before I explain it all to you...

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:44.480
I must gather my brethren. It's time.

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.280
Ad...

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:54.280
Ad, it's time.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:55.760
Yes, I heard you.

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:57.760
What are you going to do?

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.720
Are you sure, Oropo?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:03.720
Once you fire the first shot,
there'll be no turning back.

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.120
My mind's been made up for centuries.

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:43.960
Mini-Dally!
Mini-Dally is a great name for little Iop!

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.920
Don't worry, kids.
We won't name him Mini-Dally.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.120
You like the name, don't you?

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.520
Well, the thing is...

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.800
You said the first name you thought of.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:06.320
Well, I like Mini-Dally. It's so cool!

00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:17.840
The time is finally here!

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:24.840
My dear brothers and sisters,
it's time to reap what we've sown.

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.160
We've done the impossible,
but the hardest part still remains.

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:35.400
Once we've taken the gods' place,
we need to do better than they did.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:39.160
We'll need to work together.
Come to me now.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.680
You've won the right to witness a new era.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:55.520
We still have things to settle here, Ruel.
The rest isn't important.

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:59.400
Arpagone, I beg you,
my friends need me right now.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.640
I know, Ruel, you said so already.

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.320
Echo, bring Yugo to me.

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:16.720
Yugo!

00:06:20.840 --> 00:06:23.720
-Echo took him.
-They're over there.

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:31.360
Kids, I'm counting on you
to watch your mother.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:34.600
Goultard and I will end these guys,
then we'll go home.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:39.720
Sipho, I need you to keep an eye
on Evangelyne and the children.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:54.640
I know this must be confusing, Amalia,

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:56.920
but you can trust me on one thing.

00:06:58.200 --> 00:06:59.600
What's that?

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:03.680
Yugo and I are truly one.
I feel what he feels.

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:07.920
I love Adamai as a brother,
Ruel as a father.

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.480
Dally and Evangelyne like my best friends.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:14.400
But you, Amalia...

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:21.840
I have loved you forever.
I love you with a different kind of love.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:26.680
The type of love that makes you
move worlds, overcome all difficulties.

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.120
You've enchanted me.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:54.120
Oropo!

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.760
And now?
What exactly are you planning to do?

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:07.800
We're here, without knowing who you are
or where you're from.

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.320
Does it mean something?

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:14.600
What gives you the right
to talk to him like that?

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.640
Oropo doesn't have to answer you.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.000
Calm down, Echo.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.800
Everything'll be clear soon,
my dear Amalia.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:31.760
Brethren, many years ago,
many, many years for some of you...

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.560
...I promised you a better world.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:39.680
That time has come, my friends.
The Hyperzaap is complete.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:44.360
In a few moments, you, the forgotten ones,
will replace the former gods.

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.760
Take the place of the gods?

00:08:57.840 --> 00:09:00.040
You're completely out of your mind!

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:05.720
You still don't understand, Yugo.
It isn't you. It is we.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.560
Don't you see that we are one?

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:12.480
One... Ad?

00:09:12.560 --> 00:09:14.360
He's right. You're one.

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.400
I told you using the six Eliatrope Dofus

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:22.040
against Ogrest's Primordial Dofus
would have consequences.

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.840
Remember what happened
when you activated them?

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:27.160
Adamai, well--

00:09:27.240 --> 00:09:29.080
Answer, Yugo, what happened?

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:37.120
I... I saw...

00:09:37.960 --> 00:09:40.360
I saw Eliatropes...

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:44.240
Deep down you know what they are, right?

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:50.000
They're... versions of myself.

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:53.960
And there you have it.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:58.320
As your brother explained, you weren't
ready to control the Dofus' power.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.880
Your deepest desire, when you used them,
was to find your people.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:07.320
For an instant,
the Dofus distorted your intentions.

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.120
Help me, Amalia.

00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:21.840
Our birth was unique.

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:29.240
We came into the world already a few
years old, from an earlier existence.

00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:30.560
Yours, Yugo.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:35.520
Through a long corridor,
we were born at the dawn of time.

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:49.040
Disoriented by this voyage through time,
it was difficult for us to find our place.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:54.680
For millennia,
we lived in fear of changing history.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:59.680
And time passed and the more time went by,

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:04.120
the more we had access to your memories,
your desires, your loves,

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:08.160
we cherished them as much as you did,
except nothing belonged to us.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:11.840
We grew and lived in your shadow, Yugo.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:14.760
We baptized our species...

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.000
...the Eliotropes.

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:30.280
Leave her alone!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:33.040
Stop!

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:47.880
Let me by, Ad. He needs to be stopped.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:52.560
Listen, Yugo, you'd better think
about what you've learned just now.

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.600
I really don't want to fight you, Ad.

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:02.440
To fight Oropo,
you'll have to get past me.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:06.800
Stay out of this.

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.960
Don't you see this hatred has blinded you?

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.040
Fight me, Yugo!

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.480
Yugo's over there!

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:44.600
Your lizard friend, I'll have to make him
pay for his treachery.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.280
You must wait your turn.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:50.240
Why do you get to go first?
He betrayed me first.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:55.880
Maybe, but he kidnapped my kids
and hit Eva. That's worse.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.120
Okay, you have a point.

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:46.800
Stop it!

00:13:47.920 --> 00:13:49.920
I don't need you, Yugo.

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.480
One thing's for sure.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:14:00.400
If Oropo and you really are one,
there's no reason for you to worry.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:03.920
He's you, but more experienced and wiser.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.560
I think we should hear what he has to say,

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:09.640
especially as Adamai is able to trust him.

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:11.720
Amalia...

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:20.480
And while he's telling his tale,
a weapon is forming behind him.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:25.400
Oropo has an elite group of demigods,
and they really seem to believe in him.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:27.840
What's our chance of stopping them?

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:31.480
Let's listen to our hearts,
not our fists, for once.

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:39.480
You're our father, Yugo.

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:42.160
Unfortunately,
we didn't get your longevity.

00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:47.360
When Eliotropes die, their vital energy
is transferred to the others,

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:49.440
increasing their life expectancy.

00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:54.440
I am the last Eliotrope.
All the others are gone.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.440
What's that got to do with the gods?

00:14:58.520 --> 00:14:59.760
Everything.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:02.680
None of them listened to our prayers.

00:15:02.760 --> 00:15:06.400
We died one after another
and no one cared.

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:14.560
Because the gods don't care
about their children.

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.920
They don't care about us,
even though we worship them.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:20.240
Now it has to stop.

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:23.040
And you're the one to replace them,
is that it?

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:25.320
It will be you!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:29.880
All of you. I'm afraid I won't be here
to see this momentous change.

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:37.400
You exude disapproval,
father of the Eliotropes.

00:15:37.480 --> 00:15:42.760
Do you even feel any regret? After all,
you're responsible for all this.

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:45.920
Even your brother warned you.

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.920
That's enough!
Don't be so high and mighty, Oropo.

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:53.320
What's wrong with you, Echo?

00:15:53.400 --> 00:15:55.480
You're lying through your teeth!

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:59.280
The power of the Eliacube,
combined with the six Eliatrope Dofus,

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:03.040
will create a blast that'll swallow
Inglorium and the gods too.

00:16:03.120 --> 00:16:04.360
Shut up, Echo!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:09.120
To take the gods' place,
you need to destroy them.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:12.320
The only way to do that
is to cut off their followers.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:17.240
What do you think will happen
when the Eliacube covers the Dofus?

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.560
You're building a bomb?

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.640
You could call it that.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:28.640
That's not what I was told.

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:33.120
What did you think I meant
when I said replace them?

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.440
Give me back the Dofus!

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:00.760
Ad!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.400
You traitor...

00:17:22.640 --> 00:17:24.160
I forgive you.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:38.400
What are you doing? You're insane!

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:42.160
I wasn't going to be surrounded
by demigods without protection.

00:17:57.240 --> 00:17:58.080
Yugo!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:12.720
Whew! Just in time for the party.

00:18:13.280 --> 00:18:14.120
Looks like it.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:18.480
All right, let's go, Goultard!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.720
Goultard!

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:45.800
You're not the only one who's playing.

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.320
I'm not like you!

00:20:14.160 --> 00:20:17.520
You need to take responsibility,
father of the Eliotropes.

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:20.320
You're no different to the gods
that rule us.

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:24.720
You created life
and left your children to their fate.

00:20:35.600 --> 00:20:37.640
Who made you judge?

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:55.560
Who do you think you are?

